# The measurement ledger is APPEND-ONLY and written by more than one branch, so
# every conflict in it is "both sides appended at EOF". `merge=union` is what makes
# that resolvable without a human choosing which measurements to delete -- and
# deleting a measurement to resolve a merge is the one outcome the file exists to
# prevent. See docs/measurement.md.
perf/ledger.jsonl merge=union
perf/archive/*.jsonl merge=union
